            "notes": "We pick [On Me!](item_cd2a0247-bc79-4f0b-b9ee-d985e3f9a9a7) for massive survivability. It's necessary to keep you and your team alive, you can be a healer now lol. Ride with the team in the fights, pop med packs as much as possible and spam your nukes.\n\nWe get [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) for more WP and CDR, [Battery Pack](item_5ff8a68c-8f07-4531-9050-5cc5d9128b77) for more survivability and [Pulse Converter](item_a93a8a8e-28d1-4b02-8d80-3234f9eea3dc) for more CDR and a little attack speed. All of this goes a long way in round 3.",
