            "created_at": "2025-09-22T09:39:52.18083+00:00",
            "notes": "Go with [Hunker Down](item_bfe7eeda-26d6-464a-9478-6c4a388d1577) for your last power, survivability is now through the roof so long as you spam your nukes. You are Duke Nuke Em'.\n\nYou can keep [Pulse Converter](item_a93a8a8e-28d1-4b02-8d80-3234f9eea3dc) for more CDR if you wanted to, but with your new power it honestly isn't worth it in my opinion when [Battery Pack](item_5ff8a68c-8f07-4531-9050-5cc5d9128b77) adds 40% duration to *every* med pack. Sell [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Pulse Converter](item_a93a8a8e-28d1-4b02-8d80-3234f9eea3dc) to grab [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27). \n\nIf you have more money go [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) instead of [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27), or even [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) works here too.",
